{
  "name": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-attachment-security",
  "description": "Malicious-content scanner provider for Epic P3-12 must[1]: it classifies one decoded attachment payload before any parser or the model sees it, refusing a declared-vs-sniffed media-type mismatch, an over-ratio decompression (zip bomb), a polyglot, a pixel bomb, excess archive nesting, a macro-bearing document, and a native executable, published as ctx.attachmentScanner",
